DESCRIPTION:Pat O’Neill is a stand-up comedian and weekly regular on the 
 hit comedy podcast and live show Kill Tony. Originally from Massachusetts\
 , he began his comedy career in Providence\, Rhode Island\, where he perfor
 med at the Comedy Connection\, including appearances as an opener for Mark 
 Normand.\n\nNow based in Austin\, Texas\, Pat has become a fixture of one o
 f the country’s most influential comedy scenes. He performs regularly at 
 the Comedy Mothership and appears weekly on Kill Tony\, where his sharp jok
 e-writing\, distinctive perspective\, and consistently strong performances 
 have made him a regular on Kill Tony.\n\nWith a rapidly expanding online fo
 llowing and millions of views across social media platforms\, Pat continues
  to establish himself as one of the most promising rising voices in stand-u
 p comedy. He has been the closing act on Kill Tony since May 2026\, receivi
 ng rave reviews as the newest breakout star in comedy.\n\nCouple's Package 
 includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per perso
 n)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nThere is a two-item per person minim
 um in the Showroom\, which can be fulfilled with any food or drink items fr
 om the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Food and drinks purchased in the bar and loung
 e do not count towards the two-item minimum.\n\nManagement reserves the rig
 ht to prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive
  or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-
 atlas/event/special-event-pat-o-neill-31689/
